because rule number one--

00:30:35.670 --> 00:30:36.911
- No that was me talking to him.

00:30:36.911 --> 00:30:37.867
- Rule number one is--

00:30:37.867 --> 00:30:38.700
- I told him that.

00:30:38.700 --> 00:30:39.760
